Z||000000||coyote||03-24-2000||10:54 AM||||Here are some pic's of a RCC coilover and tube suspension, with Rayne custom 2" drop spindles that i put into an 87 GT.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jcks2_1.jpg"> <P><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jcks1_1.jpg"> <P>||||reg||6
