Z||000004||mrfiero||03-24-2000||08:01 PM||||I don't know about RCC, but the Ryane tubular control arms come with poly bushings.  I imagine that RCC does too.....it only makes sense on that kind of set-up.<P>I owned an '85 GT with Ryanes Slalom 1 suspension package an 12" brakes and let me tell you, that thing handled like a dream (too bad the engine conversion sucked....but that's another story).||||reg||1
Z||000005||batboy||03-24-2000||09:37 PM||||Stock brakes? Not hardly! And yes, the RCC tubular control arms come with poly bushings.||||reg||1
