Z||000014||Archie||07-21-2000||09:42 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by coyote:<BR><B>Archie:<P>I never said this car was mine, this is a reposted thread from march. wnen we were putting it together. i did however mix up the brake info, thanks for setting that straight.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I wasn't even gonna say anything until I noticed that the brake info was bassackwards.  That info could have started a whole new thread.<P>BTW, the RCC "A" arms had a rubber type bushing material (not Poly).<P>Archie||||reg||1
